graph TD
    %% 系統架構藍圖
    subgraph Frontend [前端 (Vanilla JS + CSS)]
        UI[UI/UX Dark Mode Card]
        Cam[Webcam & Mediapipe Pose]
        Chart[Chart.js 血壓圖表]
    end

    subgraph Backend_Flask [Flask 後端]
        Auth[使用者認證模組]
        SocketIO[Socket.IO 伺服器]
        API[API 路由]
        Agent[AI Agent (MCP Client)]
    end

    subgraph MCP_Server [獨立 MCP Server]
        FastMCP[FastMCP 伺服器]
        Tools[資料庫讀取 Tools]
    end

    subgraph Database [資料庫 (SQLite)]
        SQLite[(Users, Posture_Records, BP_Records)]
    end
    
    subgraph External [外部服務]
        OpenAI[OpenAI gpt-4o-mini]
    end

    UI --> Auth
    Cam -- "posture_update (WebSocket)" --> SocketIO
    UI -- "CRUD (HTTP)" --> API
    Chart -- "GET BP Data" --> API
    UI -- "Ask Advice" --> API
    API --> Agent

    SocketIO -. "寫入姿態" .-> SQLite
    API -. "寫入/查詢" .-> SQLite
    Auth -. "查詢/寫入" .-> SQLite

    Agent -- "Call Tools" --> FastMCP
    FastMCP -- "Read Data" --> Tools
    Tools -. "查詢歷史紀錄" .-> SQLite
    Agent -- "User Profile + History + Prompt" --> OpenAI
